    "content": "[@Dev B](mention://agent/a4cd9576-9c0a-412e-89c7-02643b6c13fb) Please own the implementation because you’re the squad’s only member. Fix the root cause, add the requested regression coverage, run the specified tests, and report your diff and test output. Coordinate the review and single `final.patch` with me here before moving the issue to review.",
